  "body": "42 Ara Taha Crescent, Orewa\r\n\r\nMotivated Vendor | Present Your Offer!\r\n\r\nThe vendor is serious about selling, and this could be the opportunity you've been waiting for!\r\n\r\nLocated in the popular Strathmill development in Orewa, this modern, single-level home offers easy living, comfort and a peaceful setting.\r\n\r\nWhat really sets this property apart is its position. With an open farmland outlook at the rear, you can enjoy a greater sense of space and privacy that's not always easy to find in a new development.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n3 generous bedrooms and 2 modern bathrooms\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom with ensuite\r\n\r\n300sqm (more or less) freehold section\r\nModern open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\nSingle garage plus additional off-street parking\r\nEasy indoor-outdoor flow\r\nLow-maintenance, single-level design\r\nPeaceful rural outlook at the rear\r\n\r\nConveniently located near Orewa Beach, local shops, schools and motorway access, this home is ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers or investors looking for a modern property in a desirable coastal community.\r\n\r\nTHE VENDOR'S INSTRUCTIONS ARE CLEAR - SELL!\r\n\r\nForget the asking price expectations and come see the property for yourself. The vendor is motivated and ready to consider offers.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure a modern freehold home in Orewa.\r\n\r\nContact Jacky Yu - 021 233 3771\r\n\r\nArrange your private viewing today!",
